cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FINAL ISIS"
abstract: >-
  Research software that converts scanned Canadian Space Agency ISIS-2
  ionograms into calibrated digital ionograms, and estimates an amplitude
  image that is exported in a NASA-CDF-like format. The exported amplitude
  is a model prediction, not a measured NASA observation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vollant
    given-names: Xavier
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xavier-Vollant/Final-ISIS"
keywords:
  - ionogram
  - ionosphere
  - ISIS-2
  - topside sounder
  - image calibration
